  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZnS</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>KCN</mi></math> is used as depressant.</p><p>In the metallurgy of silver and gold, the respective metal is leached with a dilute solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCN</mi></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KCN</mi></math>&nbsp;in the presence of air, which supplies <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The metal is obtained later by replacement reaction.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>CN</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Au</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>Zn</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Zn</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Copper metal is not involved in this process.</p>",
